# The trigger is "a creature or enchantment you control enters": Sol Ring (an artifact) and an Island (a land) entering draw
# nothing; Bot2's Snapcaster Mage, flashed in after the Rite resolved, is not under Bot1's control, so it draws nothing for
# Bot1; and Oath of Druids (an enchantment) and Ornithopter (a creature) each draw a card. Hand counts are checked after each
# step: the Oath's and Ornithopter's draws replace the card cast, so the hand stays at 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
